The Khafen Esolang Party.

Romeo, a young man with remarkable patience.
Juliet, a likewise young woman of remarkable grace.

Act I: The Greeting.

Scene I: A friendly exchange.

[Enter Romeo and Juliet]

Romeo:
  You are as lovely as the sum of a handsome rich lonely old warming morning and a warm summer day!
  Speak your mind!

Juliet:
  You are as brave as the sum of a bold happy peaceful proud fine rich mighty hero and a beautiful sunny day!
  Speak your mind!

[Exeunt]
